action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>普通跳跃反演是该算子思想的特例；非平凡性是对所有oracle的条件。草稿的证明含占位引文和局部记号错排，本轮只将明确的定理陈述内建，不声称已逐步核验其证明。</p>\n<p>来源：所供2007-07-28草稿，Theorem 5.10.3 (Jockusch and Shore)，印刷页32–33，PDF页52–53。核对了来源陈述；未将来源完整证明标记为已核验。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"43-df-pseudo-jump","status":"resolved","id":"cd1d0a3ff6acce66","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-pseudo-jump]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-ce","status":"resolved","id":"6c0559518cd32104","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-ce]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-jump","status":"resolved","id":"b3936ae4c5d2dc79","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-jump]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-turing-red","status":"resolved","id":"0784d1de3a88cd94","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-turing-red]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-pseudo-jump","status":"resolved","id":"cd1d0a3ff6acce66","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$e\\in\\mathbb N$；$\\operatorname{NontrivialPseudoJump}$、$V_e$ 采用 [[43-df-pseudo-jump]]；$\\operatorname{CE}$、跳跃、Turing归约分别采用 [[43-df-ce]]、[[43-df-jump]]、[[43-df-turing-red]]。","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-ce","status":"resolved","id":"6c0559518cd32104","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$e\\in\\mathbb N$；$\\operatorname{NontrivialPseudoJump}$、$V_e$ 采用 [[43-df-pseudo-jump]]；$\\operatorname{CE}$、跳跃、Turing归约分别采用 [[43-df-ce]]、[[43-df-jump]]、[[43-df-turing-red]]。","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-jump","status":"resolved","id":"b3936ae4c5d2dc79",